Subject: fixture p16

Fixture p16 expects weekly, 45000, 30, 0.70, a team alias, 2034-10-31, Juniper, and RELAY-17. It is labelled historical and is used only to test migration diagnostics.

Implication: A complete fixture can be confidently wrong for the current release.

### Record 02 — 2034-06-03 — Test author

